Conjure void stars that orbit you, defending you from incoming attacks. Each time an attack deals more than 10% of your maximum life, a star will be consumed to reduce the damage taken by [10%, 22%, 30%, 35%, 39% (TL1-5)], of which 40% will be dealt to you as entropic backlash.

You regenerate 1 star every [14, 12, 11, 9, 9 (TL1-5)] turns, stacking up to 4 times.

This talent will only function in light armor.
